From 4af99380b89998b370f5bc6c5394df5a1754181e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: rust-playground <rp@localhost>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 18:31:00 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 1/7] Run the compiler without threads on hosts that lack them

rustc compiled to wasm32-unknown-emscripten without pthreads (e.g. running in a
Cloudflare Worker) cannot spawn threads. Run the frontend on the main thread and
defer the codegen coordinator to its join, running work items inline.
RUSTC_NO_THREADS forces this mode elsewhere, to test it natively.
